==English==

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|psycho-}} + {{m|en|analysis}}, after German {{m|de|Psychoanalyse}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|psychoanalysis}} a family of theories and methods within the field of [[psychotherapy]] that work to find connections among patients' unconscious mental processes

